"""Every-frame viewer: no temporal or trial averaging in the default data."""
import json,base64
from pathlib import Path
HERE=Path(__file__).resolve().parent
def render(movies,cfg):
    doc='''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Attention · every timestep</title><style>
    :root{--ink:#16383f;--paper:#fbfaf6;--teal:#237d83}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.55 system-ui,sans-serif}header{padding:25px max(4vw,24px);background:var(--ink);color:#fff}h1{font:36px Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;margin:3px 0 8px}header p{margin:0;color:#c7ddda}.tag{font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.15em}main{max-width:1300px;margin:auto;padding:20px}.controls{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:end;flex-wrap:wrap}.card{padding:18px;background:white;border:1px solid #d7e0da;border-radius:10px;margin:15px 0}label{font-size:13px;font-weight:600}select,button{display:block;padding:8px;border:1px solid #bccfc8;border-radius:5px;background:white;font:14px system-ui;color:var(--ink)}button{cursor:pointer;background:#edf5ee}.timeline{display:flex;gap:15px;align-items:center;margin:15px 0}.timeline input{flex:1;min-width:100px}.time{font-size:21px;font-weight:650}.scene-row{display:flex;gap:25px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}.scene canvas{width:150px;height:150px;image-rendering:pixelated;border:1px solid #ced9d3}.note{font-size:13px;color:#577378;max-width:550px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}.panel{background:white;border:1px solid #d7e0da;border-radius:10px;padding:12px}.panel h2{font-size:19px;margin:0}.mass{font-size:14px;margin:5px 0}.map{display:block;width:100%;max-height:480px;object-fit:contain}.scale{height:12px;max-width:400px;background:linear-gradient(to right,#153b68,#428f94,#eed644);border-radius:4px}.caption{font-size:12px;color:#577378}a{color:var(--teal)}@media(max-width:700px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}h1{font-size:30px}}</style>
    <header><span class="tag">Actual captured weights · checkpoint8400</span><h1>Attention, one timestep at a time</h1><p>Each view is one trial at one exact frame. No averaging over time or trials.</p></header><main><div class="card"><div class="controls"><label>Task<select id="task"><option value="orientation_single">Single orientation</option><option value="orientation_binding">Two-location orientation binding</option><option value="motion_direction">Motion duration / direction</option></select></label><label>Blank delay<select id="delay"><option value="24">24 frames</option><option value="0">0 frames</option></select></label><label>Individual trial<select id="trial"></select></label><label>Map<select id="meaning"><option value="receiver">All13×13memory sites: visual / memory allocation</option><option value="key">Source keys: average across receiving queries only</option></select></label><label><input type="checkbox" id="numbers" checked> Cell values</label></div><div class="timeline"><button id="play">▶ Play</button><button id="prev">←</button><input type="range" id="time" min="0" max="28" value="0" step="1"><button id="next">→</button></div><div class="time" id="status"></div><div class="scene-row"><div class="scene"><canvas id="current" width="100" height="100"></canvas><div class="caption">Actual current stimulus frame</div></div><div class="scene"><canvas id="reference" width="100" height="100"></canvas><div class="caption" id="reference-caption"></div></div><div><div class="scale"></div><p id="scale-label" class="note">Fixed scale:0 →1, shared across tasks, heads, sources and timesteps.</p><p class="note">Each cell is one receiving location in the13×13memory grid. It shows the fraction of that location's attention assigned to visual keys or memory keys. Matching visual and memory cells sum to1.</p><p id="trial-info" class="note"></p></div></div></div><div class="grid" id="maps"></div><div class="card"><strong>These are full grids, not maps from one selected query.</strong><p>The current visual source is an encoded sensory field with short temporal traces; memory keys come from the previous rate state. Both heads can use both sources. The earlier sample/reference beside the grids is only visual context, not a reconstruction of memory.</p><p class="note">The alternative source-key view averages across receiving queries at this exact timestep. It still does not average across time or trials. Strong locality means that this population-key view can look broad even though individual connections are sharply local. The default shows source allocation at every receiving memory site directly.</p><p><a href="perframe_receipt.json">Capture receipt</a> · <a href="perframe_maps.npz">Saved numerical arrays</a> · <a href="report.md">Methods / historical phase means</a> · <a href="locality_summary.json">Measured locality</a></p></div></main>
    <script>const MOVIES=PAYLOAD;let timer=null,currentMovie=null,drawId=0;const panels=[];for(let h=0;h<2;h++)for(let s=0;s<2;s++){let el=document.createElement('div');el.className='panel';el.innerHTML='<h2>Head '+(h+1)+' · '+(s?'memory source':'current visual source')+'</h2><div class="mass"></div><canvas class="map" width="440" height="440"></canvas>';document.getElementById('maps').append(el);panels.push(el)}function stop(){if(timer)clearInterval(timer);timer=null;document.getElementById('play').textContent='▶ Play'}function choose(){stop();let f=document.getElementById('task').value,d=Number(document.getElementById('delay').value),sel=document.getElementById('trial'),old=sel.value;sel.innerHTML='';MOVIES.filter(m=>m.family===f&&m.delay===d).forEach(m=>{let o=document.createElement('option');o.value=m.trial;o.textContent='Trial '+(m.trial+1);sel.append(o)});if([...sel.options].some(o=>o.value===old))sel.value=old;trial()}function trial(){stop();currentMovie=MOVIES.find(m=>m.family===document.getElementById('task').value&&m.delay===Number(document.getElementById('delay').value)&&m.trial===Number(document.getElementById('trial').value));let slider=document.getElementById('time');slider.max=currentMovie.frames.length-1;slider.value=Math.min(Number(slider.value),Number(slider.max));draw()}function array(frame,key){if(!frame['_'+key]){let raw=atob(frame[key]),bytes=new Uint8Array(raw.length);for(let i=0;i<raw.length;i++)bytes[i]=raw.charCodeAt(i);frame['_'+key]=new Float32Array(bytes.buffer)}return frame['_'+key]}async function scene(canvas,src,token){let ctx=canvas.getContext('2d');ctx.fillStyle='#808080';ctx.fillRect(0,0,100,100);if(src){let im=new Image();im.src=src;await im.decode();if(token!==drawId)return;ctx.drawImage(im,0,0,100,100)}}function color(v){v=Math.max(0,Math.min(1,v));let a=v<.5?[21,59,104]:[66,143,148],b=v<.5?[66,143,148]:[238,214,68],t=v<.5?v*2:(v-.5)*2;return 'rgb('+a.map((x,i)=>Math.round(x+(b[i]-x)*t)).join(',')+')'}function draw(){let token=++drawId;let frame=currentMovie.frames[Number(document.getElementById('time').value)],key=document.getElementById('meaning').value,values=array(frame,key),fixed=key==='receiver'?1:.012;document.getElementById('status').textContent='Frame '+frame.t+' / '+(currentMovie.frames.length-1)+' · '+frame.phase;document.getElementById('trial-info').textContent='Individual trial '+(currentMovie.trial+1)+' of8 · '+currentMovie.family.replaceAll('_',' ')+' · delay'+currentMovie.delay+'.';document.getElementById('reference-caption').textContent=frame.reference?frame.reference_label+' — scene reference only':'No sample/reference has appeared yet';scene(document.getElementById('current'),frame.current,token);scene(document.getElementById('reference'),frame.reference,token);document.getElementById('scale-label').textContent=key==='receiver'?'Fixed scale:0 →1, shared across tasks, heads, sources and timesteps.':'Fixed key-weight scale:0 →0.012. Population average across queries at this frame only; values above ceiling saturate.';let numbers=document.getElementById('numbers').checked;for(let h=0;h<2;h++)for(let s=0;s<2;s++){let panel=panels[h*2+s],canvas=panel.querySelector('canvas'),ctx=canvas.getContext('2d'),start=(h*2+s)*169,a=values.subarray(start,start+169),mass=a.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0)/(key==='receiver'?169:1);panel.querySelector('.mass').textContent='Source mass across all169sites at this frame: '+(100*mass).toFixed(2)+'%';ctx.clearRect(0,0,440,440);ctx.font='11px system-ui';ctx.textAlign='center';ctx.textBaseline='middle';for(let y=0;y<13;y++)for(let x=0;x<13;x++){let val=a[y*13+x],v=val/fixed;ctx.fillStyle=color(v);ctx.fillRect(35+x*29,25+y*29,29,29);ctx.strokeStyle='#ffffff99';ctx.lineWidth=.8;ctx.strokeRect(35+x*29,25+y*29,29,29);if(numbers){ctx.fillStyle=v>.57?'#162e37':'#fff';ctx.font=key==='receiver'?'10px system-ui':'8px system-ui';ctx.fillText(key==='receiver'?val.toFixed(2):val.toFixed(3),49.5+x*29,39.5+y*29)}}ctx.fillStyle='#16383f';ctx.font='11px system-ui';for(let k=0;k<13;k++){ctx.fillText(k,49.5+k*29,12);ctx.fillText(k,18,39.5+k*29)}ctx.fillText('Grid column',225,422);ctx.save();ctx.translate(5,212);ctx.rotate(-Math.PI/2);ctx.fillText('Grid row',0,0);ctx.restore()}}function step(dir){let t=document.getElementById('time');t.value=Math.max(0,Math.min(Number(t.max),Number(t.value)+dir));draw()}document.getElementById('task').onchange=choose;document.getElementById('delay').onchange=choose;document.getElementById('trial').onchange=trial;document.getElementById('time').oninput=draw;document.getElementById('meaning').onchange=draw;document.getElementById('numbers').onchange=draw;document.getElementById('prev').onclick=()=>{stop();step(-1)};document.getElementById('next').onclick=()=>{stop();step(1)};document.getElementById('play').onclick=()=>{if(timer){stop();return}document.getElementById('play').textContent='❚❚ Pause';timer=setInterval(()=>{let t=document.getElementById('time');if(Number(t.value)===Number(t.max)){stop();return}step(1)},550)};choose();</script></html>'''
    (HERE/'index.html').write_text(doc.replace('PAYLOAD',json.dumps(movies,separators=(',',':'))),encoding='utf-8')
    report=HERE/'report.md';text=report.read_text(encoding='utf-8');prefix='# Current viewer: every timestep, no temporal averaging\n\nThe default [viewer](index.html) now shows one individual trial at one exact frame, with a slider/playback for every timestep of all three tasks and D0/D24. Eight paired trials per task/delay were captured with the unchanged frozen model within the original attention-visualization deadline. All13×13receiving sites are shown for each head/source on a fixed0–1scale. The alternative key view averages only over queries at the selected frame.\n\nThe older figures and sections below are **phase averages**, retained as historical summaries. They must not be described as instantaneous maps. See [per-frame receipt](perframe_receipt.json).\n\n---\n\n'
    if not text.startswith('# Current viewer:'):report.write_text(prefix+text,encoding='utf-8')
if __name__=='__main__':render(json.loads((HERE/'perframe_movies.json').read_text()),json.loads((HERE/'config.json').read_text()))
